{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up as a house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your limbs stretch through endless rooms filled with grotesque creatures. You can never see outside of yourself, never feel the world that lies beyond the fleshy walls of your body. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You manage your insides as best as you can, but you wonder : are you a good house or just a pale afterthought of the House Before ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The House Before is a story based adventure game with some light puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/THB_2.gif?t=1739453863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal old wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/THB_1.gif?t=1739453863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a good house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/THB_4.gif?t=1739453863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember who you used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/THB_5.gif?t=1739453863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise your children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset